T024 evidence, first capture: User Story 1 on hardware, 2026-10-28.

Image: built from HEAD d455767 with the changes later committed as cef0a6b still in
the working tree, so /etc/build-info says VERSION=d455767-dirty. That is the honest
stamp for what was booted. The re-test after the seed fix below is built from a clean
commit.

